{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J2uMJ3U8aO1795506824.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>證監會主席黃天祐表示，無紙證券的落實，為市場未來改革鋪好道路。</p><p></p><p>香港證監會主席黃天祐說：「港交所正在積極地推動，港股交收及結算周期從『T+2』縮短到『T+1』，無紙化打下了紮實的根基，正是為市場進一步提升運作效率，與國際標準接軌鋪好道路。二十年磨一劍，今天首家企業在新制度下，標誌著這場無紙化改革的新起點。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.839904+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:37:14.012760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:17.566606+00:00","content_hash":"5e059c53ad76b0979f3793ec9ab0b407e56a55a2fb2209119a6793d75b65ec30","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.839904+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}